FF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-2g/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fuzzy matcher and picker presentation engine (CaptureCore)[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add a pure, Foundation-only fuzzy matcher, the task display-text [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parser for code spans and wikilinks, and the grouped/filtered picker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]presentation with navigation helpers. Ship thorough CaptureCore unit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests; the app's behavior does not change.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Picker state machine, keyboard routing, focus, and a [/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]functional picker view[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]picker-flow[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker-flow: route `active_task` completion into a modal picker state. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]This covers open, suppress, and reopen rules, full-snapshot fetch, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accept and accept-and-submit, the two-stage Escape, trigger removal on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Backspace, and the reopen chip. Add picker key routing, an AppKit-owned [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter field, and live-preview suppression for an incomplete `^`. Ship a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plain but fully working picker view, fake-bob fixtures, tests, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README behavior docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Beautiful picker card, sizing, accessibility, docs, and macOS [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]verification[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]picker-design[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, picker-flow[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker-design: replace the functional view with the final design, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]including the large card, pinned Pomodoro headers, rich rows, detail [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip, empty states, chip, and key-hint footer. Add the fixed-height [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sizing policy, accessibility announcements, README visuals, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendered-image review, and macOS build, test, and lint verification.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-2g","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-2g.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-1d1d6f12bfbe54b894dc4d40d115dcb8","started_at":"2026-09-28T22:28:32.637171+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"0a7b3f7dd8a675d4afe0b6331bb594e6444316dd7c21c4ca8e26fa872236f486","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2g.land--gate/chat.md","size_bytes":553},"commits":{"digest":"47836eb31e6c703b65e5496d901681edb09d7382a1eba7e8455efca63ea23241","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2g.land--gate/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"04e2701a73aa9a3c8513759f7115fe85e595b552f78c71b3dcb915648cbd201b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2g.land--gate/meta.json","size_bytes":750},"state":{"digest":"dd934c53c1bbd74a75b669e08d0ce27b3fb6d761421e7b1acfcd1915d6221212","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2g.land--gate/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2g.land--gate","local_name":"bob-cli-2g.land--gate","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-2g","agent_clan_generation":"20260928182822","agent_session":"bob-cli-2g.land","agent_session_role":"gate","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-2g","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-